stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued : POST /api/runs
  queued --> cancelled : 启动前已取消
  queued --> running : queueMicrotask 执行
  running --> succeeded : Agent 正常完成
  running --> failed : Provider / Adapter 异常
  running --> cancelled : 用户取消 / 超时 / 事件上限
  succeeded --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]

  note right of running
    同一 conversationId
    同时只允许一个 active run
  end note
